        "sourceSha256": "cf1d08eb4d49e671390d9aa17f6566a0c864448cedfda2ca171c7ee0bc71ca7d",
        "quote": "Exposure to the disease organism can occur through infection with the actual disease (resulting in natural immunity), or introduction of a killed or weakened form of the disease organism through vaccination (vaccine-induced immunity).",
