      "explanation": "An obesity epidemic developing over a few generations is explained by changes in eating patterns and activity, not a rapid change in the population’s genes. Sedentary living and poor eating habits both contribute, and decreased leisure activity overlaps with sedentary living; this wording does not identify one uniquely most common cause.",
