      "explanation": "A statin can prevent a first cardiovascular event in a person at high risk, or prevent further events in someone with established cardiovascular disease. The question supplies neither situation, so prescribing a statin alone does not establish secondary prevention. Smoking cessation, exercise and education can also be used at different stages.",
